ind": "text", "text": "A pig-stye.", "bbox": {"x": 130.5620871589836, "y": 397.5303644648691, "width": 101.21664564950125, "height": 23.423039130369727}}, {"kind": "text", "text": "L003.", "bbox": {"x": 33.57142840357144, "y": 416.43333326419116, "width": 57.07142857142858, "height": 23.50833333333343}}, {"kind": "text", "text": "West.", "bbox": {"x": 251.7857141066667, "y": 396.28333326616666, "width": 53.714285714285666, "height": 20.149999999999928}}, {"kind": "text", "text": "LORDEYN.", "bbox": {"x": 480.07142672500004, "y": 389.56666633083336, "width": 117.50000000000001, "height": 20.149999999999928}}, {"kind": "text", "text": "See Fever-Laurden.", "bbox": {"x": 607.2456672348208, "y": 389.16135016581256, "width": 182.07611765180317, "height": 27.841025185585167}}, {"kind": "text", "text": "«i The lurgy -", "bbox": {"x": 791.5261801636736, "y": 391.01789082864525, "width": 125.74094663347518, "height": 27.162990478674548}}, {"kind": "text", "text": "\" At hym ful fast thei loos,\"", "bbox": {"x": 211.49999983214286, "y": 413.0749999845339, "width": 255.1428571428572, "height": 23.50833333333325}}, {"kind": "text", "text": "fever, idleness,\" Craven Glossary, p. 304.", "bbox": {"x": 496.5457099275645, "y": 410.2307352014293, "width": 373.2367962428502, "height": 30.903998736540522}}, {"kind": "text", "text": "MS. Cantat. Ff. t.48, 1. 06.", "bbox": {"x": 53.44179805108497, "y": 436.0683771592124, "width": 252.26475361415314, "height": 28.825563665231023}}, {"kind": "text", "text": "1 trow he was infecte certeyn", "bbox": {"x": 536.9123929817521, "y": 433.57330865592934, "width": 232.1456909179688, "height": 20.380542401472773}}, {"kind": "text", "text": "LOP. (1) A flea. North.", "bbox": {"x": 33.571428420641624, "y": 460.09166664959025, "width": 231.64285714285717, "height": 20.15000000000011}}, {"kind": "text", "text": "（A.-S.）", "bbox": {"x": 278.642856975, "y": 460.09166661629166, "width": 73.85714285714289, "height": 20.15000000000011}}, {"kind": "text", "text": "With the faitour, or the fever lordeyn,", "bbox": {"x": 536.8125620844902, "y": 451.6964088929123, "width": 299.4175349644252, "height": 25.061433108647687}}, {"kind": "text", "text": "Ys joy y-now so ye your lyggys streyne,", "bbox": {"x": 93.99999979944342, "y": 480.24166665358223, "width": 308.8571428571429, "height": 20.149999999999928}}, {"kind": "text", "text": "MS. Rawl. C. 86, xv. Cent.", "bbox": {"x": 701.6428568661196, "y": 473.52499997277033, "width": 211.50000000000003, "height": 20.149999999999928}}, {"kind": "text", "text": "Ye lade longe-sydyde as a loppe.", "bbox": {"x": 90.64285688250729, "y": 500.3916666461056, "width": 255.1428571428571, "height": 20.149999999999928}}, {"kind": "text", "text": "LORD-FEST.", "bbox": {"x": 476.6655184679404, "y": 493.42891297573567, "width": 134.38324846540183, "height": 27.358840624491492}}, {"kind": "text", "text": "MS. Fairfas 16.", "bbox": {"x": 339.0714284035714, "y": 520.5416666439753, "width": 124.21428571428574, "height": 16.791666666666607}}, {"kind": "text", "text": "Excessively lordly. (4.-S.)", "bbox": {"x": 617.7142855417659, "y": 497.0333333170081, "width": 255.1428571428571, "height": 23.50833333333325}}, {"kind": "text", "text": "2) To lollop or lounge about.", "bbox": {"x": 36.928571252845956, "y": 540.6916666509245, "width": 271.92857142857144, "height": 20.15000000000011}}, {"kind": "text", "text": "Kent.", "bbox": {"x": 305.49999984201685, "y": 540.6916666172795, "width": 73.85714285714283, "height": 16.791666666666785}}, {"kind": "text", "text": "LORDINGS, Sirs; masters. (4.-S.)", "bbox": {"x": 480.07142839464285, "y": 517.1833333208288, "width": 332.3571428571429, "height": 23.50833333333343}}, {"kind": "text", "text": "It is often", "bbox": {"x": 818.9418247946085, "y": 519.4858545356292, "width": 94.51281002589641, "height": 19.824229246377836}}, {"kind": "text", "text": "(3) To hang loosely; to hang down, or droop.", "bbox": {"x": 36.9285712414033, "y": 560.8416666562647, "width": 423.0000000000001, "height": 23.50833333333343}}, {"kind": "text", "text": "used by later writers in contempt.", "bbox": {"x": 496.85714269691556, "y": 540.6916666552178, "width": 315.5714285714286, "height": 20.15000000000011}}, {"kind": "text", "text": "LORD-OF-MISRULE.", "bbox": {"x": 476.7142855380357, "y": 560.8416666498749, "width": 211.49999999999997, "height": 20.15000000000011}}, {"kind": "text", "text": "The person who pre-", "bbox": {"x": 707.8718807525253, "y": 560.4996539996122, "width": 202.30646869114474, "height": 27.8066484014193}}, {"kind": "text", "text": "Var. dial", "bbox": {"x": 60.428571260714286, "y": 584.3499999634963, "width": 77.21428571428572, "height": 16.791666666666785}}, {"kind": "text", "text": "sided over the Christmas revels, by no means", "bbox": {"x": 500.2142879383929, "y": 580.9916663728127, "width": 412.92857142857133, "height": 23.50833333333325}}, {"kind": "text", "text": "4) The faggot wood of a tree.", "bbox": {"x": 36.92857124905757, "y": 607.8583333193403, "width": 265.2142857142858, "height": 20.149999999999928}}, {"kind": "text", "text": "LOPE.", "bbox": {"x": 33.5714283739496, "y": 628.0083332839462, "width": 67.14285714285714, "height": 16.791666666666607}}, {"kind": "text", "text": "Leapt.", "bbox": {"x": 107.42857126071429, "y": 628.0083332703646, "width": 67.14285714285715, "height": 20.149999999999928}}, {"kind": "text", "text": "Also, to leap.", "bbox": {"x": 184.64285695821428, "y": 628.0083332997501, "width": 130.92857142857144, "height": 20.149999999999928}}, {"kind": "text", "text": "an ummportant personage in the olden times.", "bbox": {"x": 500.2142855339947, "y": 607.8583333240047, "width": 409.5714285714285, "height": 20.149999999999928}}, {"kind": "text", "text": "It seems to be", "bbox": {"x": 328.9999998173319, "y": 624.6499999703676, "width": 137.64285714285714, "height": 20.15000000000011}}, {"kind": "text", "text": "a subst. in the second example.", "bbox": {"x": 50.35714304514287, "y": 648.1583332930334, "width": 282.00000000000006, "height": 20.149999999999928}}, {"kind": "text", "text": "He began his rule on All-hallow eve and con-", "bbox": {"x": 503.57142831645564, "y": 628.0083333205802, "width": 402.8571428571428, "height": 20.149999999999928}}, {"kind": "text", "text": "As sone as the chylde had spoke,", "bbox": {"x": 87.28571411561903, "y": 671.6666666554723, "width": 261.85714285714283, "height": 16.791666666666607}}, {"kind": "text", "text": "tinued it till Candlemas day. See a list of exences, dated in 1552, in Kempe's Losele", "bbox": {"x": 499.80944694748814, "y": 644.5007303275127, "width": 410.1860501425607, "height": 52.67985872824968}}, {"kind": "text", "text": "The fende ynto hym was lope.", "bbox": {"x": 90.6428568562718, "y": 688.4583333087602, "width": 241.71428571428572, "height": 20.149999999999928}}, {"kind": "text", "text": "NS. Harl、 1701, f.40.", "bbox": {"x": 295.42857126414, "y": 708.6083333161992, "width": 167.8571428571429, "height": 16.79166666666643}}, {"kind": "text", "text": "Manuscripts, pp. 44-54.", "bbox": {"x": 502.7788462384284, "y": 687.9875669174032, "width": 209.40191377912245, "height": 30.38914926449459}}, {"kind": "text", "text": "or further informa", "bbox": {"x": 734.8516174727426, "y": 692.4540140596118, "width": 165.2694519587926, "height": 20.601047364870684}}, {"kind": "text", "text": "tion on the subject, see Brand, i. 272; Arch.", "bbox": {"x": 496.6495292764788, "y": 711.7571577161237, "width": 413.3383020673479, "height": 27.810365200042725}}, {"kind": "text", "text": "Tyme goth fast, it is full lyght of lope,", "bbox": {"x": 93.9999998609933, "y": 732.1166666535482, "width": 305.5, "height": 16.791666666666607}}, {"kind": "text", "text": "xviii, 313-335; Hawkins' Engl. Dram. iii. 156;", "bbox": {"x": 500.2142855344387, "y": 735.4749999897194, "width": 406.2142857142857, "height": 20.149999999999928}}, {"kind": "text", "text": "And in abydyng men seyn ther lyghte hope.", "bbox": {"x": 90.64285695892858, "y": 748.9083333226154, "width": 345.78571428571433, "height": 20.149999999999928}}, {"kind": "text", "text": "MS. Rawl. Poet. 118.", "bbox": {"x": 298.78571411436013, "y": 769.058333315842, "width": 164.50000000000003, "height": 16.791666666666607}}, {"kind": "text", "text": "Strutt, ii. 200; Lilly's Sixe Court Comedies,", "bbox": {"x": 500.2142855273539, "y": 755.624999973286, "width": 406.2142857142857, "height": 23.50833333333325}}, {"kind": "text", "text": "LOP-EARED. Having long pendulous ears like a hound. Var. dial.", "bbox": {"x": 30.21428554105715, "y": 789.2083333051233, "width": 433.0714285714285, "height": 43.65833333333336}}, {"kind": "text", "text": "LOUDS AND. LADIES.", "bbox": {"x": 476.7142855258746, "y": 779.133333288784, "width": 231.64285714285717, "height": 43.65833333333336}}, {"kind": "text", "text": "See Bulls-and-Cows.", "bbox": {"x": 704.710018121901, "y": 798.9882757640003, "width": 202.147719519479, "height": 24.54931879043579}}, {"kind": "text", "text": "LOPEN.", "bbox": {"x": 30.190907287479515, "y": 832.7687759780378, "width": 83.97532790047782, "height": 20.345781286557575}}, {"kind": "text", "text": "Leapt.", "bbox": {"x": 110.78571378214286, "y": 832.8666664651668, "width": 77.21428571428571, "height": 20.149999999999928}}, {"kind": "text", "text": "LORDSHIP.", "bbox": {"x": 483.33274035639795, "y": 822.2503135472092, "width": 110.97737612043105, "height": 21.232706161339923}}, {"kind": "text", "text": "See the Sevyn Sages, 739.", "bbox": {"x": 204.7857141153887, "y": 832.8666666493812, "width": 238.35714285714286, "height": 23.50833333333325}}, {"kind": "text", "text": "Supreme power. (4.-S.)", "bbox": {"x": 607.6428569480229, "y": 822.7916666456771, "width": 238.3571428571429, "height": 23.50833333333325}}, {"kind": "text", "text": "LORD-SIZE", "bbox": {"x": 483.42857293928563, "y": 842.9416663868054, "width": 110.7857142857143, "height": 16.791666666666785}}, {"kind": "text", "text": "Whan thy mouthe with shryfte ys opun", "bbox": {"x": 87.28571411785715, "y": 856.3749999911624, "width": 318.92857142857144, "height": 16.791666666666607}}, {"kind": "text", "text": "The judge at the assizes.", "bbox": {"x": 614.3571424072858, "y": 846.2999999597, "width": 224.92857142857136, "height": 20.149999999999928}}, {"kind": "text", "text": "Deth and synne are bothe oute lopan.", "bbox": {"x": 90.64285831785712, "y": 873.1666663308334, "width": 285.35714285714283, "height": 20.15000000000011}}, {"kind": "text", "text": "LORD'S-ROOM.", "bbox": {"x": 476.7142855427795, "y": 866.4499999780977, "width": 157.78571428571436, "height": 20.15000000000011}}, {"kind": "text", "text": "The stage-box in a theatre", "bbox": {"x": 647.6537940870874, "y": 866.0526319071512, "width": 262.40477371215815, "height": 24.41687921484321}}, {"kind": "text", "text": "MS. Haxl. 1701, f. 79.", "bbox": {"x": 288.7142856583333, "y": 889.9583329975001, "width": 171.21428571428575, "height": 20.15000000000011}}, {"kind": "text", "text": "was formerly so called. Jonson.", "bbox": {"x": 496.8571426634615, "y": 889.9583333178335, "width": 292.07142857142856, "height": 20.149999999999928}}, {"kind": "text", "text": "The portar set the yatys opon,", "bbox": {"x": 107.42857125098345, "y": 916.8249999853986, "width": 245.07142857142858, "height": 20.149999999999928}}, {"kind": "text", "text": "LORDSWYK.", "bbox": {"x": 476.4739106936308, "y": 907.9040348559629, "width": 131.26425497872486, "height": 22.982474386692047}}, {"kind": "text", "text": "A traitor.", "bbox": {"x": 624.4285699738095, "y": 906.7499996081945, "width": 94.0000000000001, "height": 23.50833333333325}}, {"kind": "text", "text": "Ritson.", "bbox": {"x": 721.7857140698981, "y": 913.4666666066964, "width": 80.57142857142856, "height": 16.791666666666607}}, {"kind": "text", "text": "And with that Befyse ys owt lopon.", "bbox": {"x": 107.09304960527956, "y": 930.5142442482842, "width": 272.59123011997764, "height": 26.690466231107784}}, {"kind": "text", "text": "LORE. (1) Knowledge; doctrine ; advice. (4.-S.)", "bbox": {"x": 476.45871867234786, "y": 926.6363171591381, "width": 433.5770285470146, "height": 31.242845543225524}}, {"kind": "text", "text": "MS. Cantab. Ff. II. 33, f. 108.", "bbox": {"x": 231.37032010090616, "y": 947.3967404249198, "width": 228.93561771937777, "height": 27.751687502860914}}, {"kind": "text", "text": "Anoon was al that feire gederynge", "bbox": {"x": 107.42857130792413, "y": 977.2749999842578, "width": 275.28571428571433, "height": 20.149999999999928}}, {"kind": "text", "text": "(2) Lost.", "bbox": {"x": 476.71428552453415, "y": 953.7666666155617, "width": 87.28571428571433, "height": 23.50833333333325}}, {"kind": "text", "text": "Still in use in Somerset.", "bbox": {"x": 574.0714279209822, "y": 953.7666666036979, "width": 221.5714285714286, "height": 20.149999999999928}}, {"kind": "text", "text": "Lopen undir oure lordes wynge.", "bbox": {"x": 107.42857125844593, "y": 997.424999986385, "width": 251.78571428571428, "height": 20.15000000000011}}, {"kind": "text", "text": "The kyng seld, Take me thy tayle,", "bbox": {"x": 553.9285712566696, "y": 977.2749999878614, "width": 285.35714285714283, "height": 20.15000000000011}}, {"kind": "text", "text": "Cureor Mundi, MS. Coll, Trin, Cantab, f. 111.", "bbox": {"x": 117.49999988888331, "y": 1014.2166666524766, "width": 345.78571428571433, "height": 20.149999999999928}}, {"kind": "text", "text": "For my hors I wolde not the fayle,", "bbox": {"x": 553.9285710089284, "y": 994.0666666370342, "width": 285.35714285714295, "height": 20.15000000000011}}, {"kind": "text", "text": "Sythen he ys lopen on hys stede,", "bbox": {"x": 107.42857125372028, "y": 1034.3666666526735, "width": 251.78571428571428, "height": 20.149999999999928}}, {"kind": "text", "text": "A peny that thou fore.", "bbox": {"x": 553.9285712278726, "y": 1014.2166666447644, "width": 184.64285714285714, "height": 20.15000000000011}}, {"kind": "text", "text": "MS. Cantab. FL. T. 40, C. 51.", "bbox": {"x": 678.1428569670068, "y": 1034.3666666506747, "width": 228.28571428571422, "height": 20.149999999999928}}, {"kind": "text", "text": "He with hym Harrawde dud lede.", "bbox": {"x": 104.07142806785717, "y": 1051.1583331318334, "width": 265.21428571428567, "height": 20.15000000000011}}, {"kind": "text", "text": "MS. Cantab. Fl. iI. 38, f. 154.", "bbox": {"x": 231.64285703095237, "y": 1071.3083332493752, "width": 228.28571428571433, "height": 20.149999999999928}}, {"kind": "text", "text": "LOREFADYR. A teacher. Loremastir, Dial.", "bbox": {"x": 476.46336514773407, "y": 1050.0886295467426, "width": 430.1833103724889, "height": 31.99500003655754}}, {"kind": "text", "text": "Creat. Moral. p. 243.", "bbox": {"x": 496.39640136548155, "y": 1071.4067253373537, "width": 192.32003675188335, "height": 28.53677273591369}}, {"kind": "text", "text": "LOPE-STAFF. A leaping-staff.", "bbox": {"x": 30.214285542431973, "y": 1091.4583333173414, "width": 288.71428571428567, "height": 26.86666666666657}}, {"kind": "text", "text": "« A lope-staffe", "bbox": {"x": 318.39177788965907, "y": 1090.6717230333327, "width": 145.2856513432094, "height": 26.657678814729078}}, {"kind": "text", "text": "Of al men they do most evyl,", "bbox": {"x": 513.6428569750001, "y": 1098.174999984735, "width": 228.28571428571422, "height": 20.149999999999928}}, {"kind": "text", "text": "wherewith men leape ditches,\" Cotgrave.", "bbox": {"x": 50.35714393622449, "y": 1111.6083331414286, "width": 365.92857142857144, "height": 26.86666666666675}}, {"kind": "text", "text": "LOPIRD. Coagulated. Still in use. See Forby,", "bbox": {"x": 26.857142681030403, "y": 1135.116666657032, "width": 436.42857142857144, "height": 23.50833333333325}}, {"kind": "text", "text": "Here lorefadyr ys the devyl. MS. Harl. 1701, f 24,", "bbox": {"x": 513.6428568662475, "y": 1114.9666666524765, "width": 392.7857142857143, "height": 20.149999999999928}}, {"kind": "text", "text": "LOREINE.", "bbox": {"x": 466.642856975, "y": 1135.1166666330832, "width": 114.14285714285711, "height": 20.15000000000011}}, {"kind": "text", "text": "A rein.", "bbox": {"x": 594.2142855277779, "y": 1138.4749999533565, "width": 73.85714285714283, "height": 16.791666666666607}}, {"kind": "text", "text": "See Lannfal, 888.", "bbox": {"x": 680.9448261090994, "y": 1131.9894294330084, "width": 165.75938960484095, "height": 28.648334344228168}}, {"kind": "text", "text": "Brockett, Grose, Kennett, &c.", "bbox": {"x": 50.35714267794404, "y": 1158.624999986385, "width": 271.92857142857144, "height": 20.15000000000011}}, {"kind": "text", "text": "Hys treine lemyd alle with pride,", "bbox": {"x": 550.5714283926716, "y": 1158.6249999869156, "width": 275.2857142857143, "height": 20.149999999999928}}, {"kind": "text", "text": "Thare he fande none other fode,", "bbox": {"x": 67.14285697282006, "y": 1182.1333333224297, "width": 261.85714285714283, "height": 16.791666666666607}}, {"kind": "text", "text": "Stede and armure alle was blake.", "bbox": {"x": 550.3363947030995, "y": 1175.1808776836572, "width": 262.37447357177734, "height": 23.98057653903954}}, {"kind": "text", "text": "Bot wlatesome glete and lopird blode", "bbox": {"x": 67.14285697304824, "y": 1198.924999988285, "width": 292.07142857142856, "height": 20.149999999999928}}, {"kind": "text", "text": "MS. Harl.9252, f.104.", "bbox": {"x": 731.4244099105587, "y": 1192.9728605784105, "width": 178.90920230320526, "height": 25.124661922454834}}, {"kind": "text", "text": "MS. Lincoln A. 1. 17, f. 276.", "bbox": {"x": 245.07142840357145, "y": 1219.0749999837499, "width": 214.85714285714292, "height": 20.15000000000011}}, {"kind": "text", "text": "LOREL.", "bbox": {"x": 473.26412598118907, "y": 1218.6799848059452, "width": 84.11460481371202, "height": 20.940030288696253}}, {"kind": "text", "text": "A bad worthless fellow.", "bbox": {"x": 567.3571426672717, "y": 1219.0749999834836, "width": 245.07142857142853, "height": 20.15000000000011}}, {"kind": "text", "text": "（4.-N.）", "bbox": {"x": 819.1428569435268, "y": 1219.0749999370312, "width": 83.92857142857142, "height": 20.149999999999928}}, {"kind": "text", "text": "Thare dwelled a man in a myrke donjowne,", "bbox": {"x": 67.142856970111, "y": 1242.5833333235516, "width": 355.8571428571429, "height": 20.149999999999928}}, {"kind": "text", "text": "Lorels den, Holinshed, Chron. Ireland, p. 93.", "bbox": {"x": 496.85714268789843, "y": 1242.5833333236192, "width": 409.5714285714286, "height": 23.50833333333343}}, {"kind": "text", "text": "And In a fowle stede of corrupeyowne,", "bbox": {"x": 66.91140887828446, "y": 1256.5975135251178, "width": 309.3918647766113, "height": 24.895579977830238}}, {"kind": "text", "text": "Cocke Lorel was formerly a generic title for", "bbox": {"x": 496.8571426820506, "y": 1262.7333333232004, "width": 412.92857142857144, "height": 23.50833333333343}}, {"kind": "text", "text": "Whare he had no fode,", "bbox": {"x": 66.88094599002682, "y": 1276.4325458733197, "width": 188.5793012891497, "height": 23.504461201032026}}, {"kind": "text", "text": "a very great rascal.", "bbox": {"x": 493.4999998286458, "y": 1286.241666645677, "width": 171.2142857142857, "height": 20.15000000000011}}, {"kind": "text", "text": "Bot wlatsome glette and lopyrd blode.", "bbox": {"x": 67.14285696728246, "y": 1299.6749999903498, "width": 305.5, "height": 16.791666666666607}}, {"kind": "text", "text": "\" Lasy lorrels,\" Harman,", "bbox": {"x": 671.4285718482142, "y": 1279.5249996221876, "width": 235.00000000000003, "height": 30.225000000000072}}, {"kind": "text", "text": "1567.", "bbox": {"x": 493.49999982015305, "y": 1306.3916665947022, "width": 57.07142857142858, "height": 20.15000000000011}}, {"kind": "text", "text": "LOP-LOACH.", "bbox": {"x": 30.214285532818526, "y": 1336.6166666394367, "width": 134.2857142857143, "height": 20.15000000000011}}, {"kind": "text", "text": "Hampole, MS. Bowes, p. 25.", "bbox": {"x": 241.71428554642858, "y": 1319.8249999868815, "width": 214.85714285714292, "height": 16.791666666666607}}, {"kind": "text", "text": "The leech used by surgeons for", "bbox": {"x": 174.3052480953086, "y": 1335.7654894267093, "width": 285.82296589442666, "height": 26.312430498997347}}, {"kind": "text", "text": "LOREMAR. A bit-maker. Palsgrave. \" Lori.", "bbox": {"x": 473.3571426925138, "y": 1326.5416666553647, "width": 436.42857142857133, "height": 23.50833333333343}}, {"kind": "text", "text": "drawing blood.", "bbox": {"x": 53.71428558839285, "y": 1360.124999964018, "width": 137.64285714285714, "height": 20.15000000000011}}, {"kind": "text", "text": "North.", "bbox": {"x": 191.35714268928572, "y": 1360.1249999506128, "width": 63.7857142857143, "height": 16.791666666666607}}, {"kind": "text", "text": "mers or bit-makers,\" Harrison, p. 97.", "bbox": {"x": 493.3424933800413, "y": 1344.4018091008604, "width": 346.19874899727955, "height": 29.827634032567474}}, {"kind": "text", "text": "LOPLOLLY• Lame.", "bbox": {"x": 27.821796235011806, "y": 1361.2384473618772, "width": 181.93779482160295, "height": 67.71326506137848}}, {"kind": "text", "text": "LORENGE.", "bbox": {"x": 473.3571426780952, "y": 1370.1999999664167, "width": 114.14285714285715, "height": 20.149999999999928}}, {"kind": "text", "text": "A lazy fellow. West.", "bbox": {"x": 157.7857140944352, "y": 1380.2749999726648, "width": 204.7857142857143, "height": 23.50833333333343}}, {"kind": "text", "text": "Iron.（4.-N.）", "bbox": {"x": 600.8848563197287, "y": 1369.9410891526454, "width": 137.73028700692322, "height": 24.026154963175433}}, {"kind": "text", "text": "LOPPING.", "bbox": {"x": 30.21428592410714, "y": 1400.4249998740625, "width": 100.71428571428572, "height": 20.15000000000011}}, {"kind": "text", "text": "Dorset.", "bbox": {"x": 221.57142838492067, "y": 1403.7833332866899, "width": 67.14285714285714, "height": 16.791666666666607}}, {"kind": "text", "text": "LORER.", "bbox": {"x": 473.2272785275549, "y": 1393.1525485867983, "width": 84.18829972403388, "height": 21.261569400628467}}, {"kind": "text", "text": "The laurel-tree.", "bbox": {"x": 567.3571426509183, "y": 1393.7083333093453, "width": 151.07142857142864, "height": 16.791666666666785}}, {"kind": "text", "text": "Chaucer.", "bbox": {"x": 728.2358989294265, "y": 1394.3921502065864, "width": 87.84740665980755, "height": 18.112374448776173}}, {"kind": "text", "text": "This Daphne into a lorer tre", "bbox": {"x": 550.5714282636904, "y": 1413.8583333100116, "width": 228.28571428571422, "height": 16.791666666666607}}, {"kind": "text", "text": "LOP-SIDED. One-sided. Var. dial.", "bbox": {"x": 30.214285563029822, "y": 1423.933333322262, "width": 342.42857142857144, "height": 20.149999999999928}}, {"kind": "text", "text": "LOP-START.", "bbox": {"x": 26.857142684623007, "y": 1447.4416666386803, "width": 130.92857142857142, "height": 20.15000000000011}}, {"kind": "text", "text": "The stoat.", "bbox": {"x": 174.5714300944781, "y": 1444.0833329975, "width": 107.42856502532959, "height": 20.15000000000011}}, {"kind": "text", "text": "Was turnid, whiche is ever grene.", "bbox": {"x": 553.6671761204794, "y": 1430.7032813333094, "width": 269.08110100882385, "height": 24.241149584452252}}, {"kind": "text", "text": "East.", "bbox": {"x": 288.7142855464285, "y": 1447.4416665967015, "width": 53.71428571428572, "height": 16.791666666666607}}, {"kind": "text", "text": "It is men-", "bbox": {"x": 352.4999996642857, "y": 1447.4416665947024, "width": 107.42857142857144, "height": 20.149999999999928}}, {"kind": "text", "text": "Gower, MS. Soc. Antiq. 134, f. 95.", "bbox": {"x": 641.2142855442199, "y": 1454.1583333222861, "width": 265.2142857142858, "height": 16.791666666666607}}, {"kind": "text", "text": "tioned in Harrison's England, p. 230.", "bbox": {"x": 50.35714268928573, "y": 1467.5916666546727, "width": 335.7142857142857, "height": 23.50833333333325}}, {"kind": "text", "text": "And plaunted trees that were to preise,", "bbox": {"x": 530.4285711279902, "y": 1474.3083333099032, "width": 312.2142857142857, "height": 20.149999999999928}}, {"kind": "text", "text": "LOPUSTER.", "bbox": {"x": 26.857142675297634, "y": 1487.7416666246875, "width": 127.57142857142857, "height": 20.15000000000011}}, {"kind": "text", "text": "A lobster.", "bbox": {"x": 154.4285712439286, "y": 1491.0999999580208, "width": 107.42857142857142, "height": 16.791666666666785}}, {"kind": "text", "text": "Of cldre, palme, and of lorers,", "bbox": {"x": 530.4285712299404, "y": 1494.4583333165417, "width": 245.0714285714286, "height": 20.149999999999928}}, {"kind": "text", "text": "LOPWEBBE.", "bbox": {"x": 26.857142684623007, "y": 1511.249999972014, "width": 130.92857142857142, "height": 20.149999999999928}}, {"kind": "text", "text": "11.", "bbox": {"x": 73.85714258857143, "y": 1534.7583331318335, "width": 26.857142857142847, "height": 20.149999999999928}}, {"kind": "text", "text": "A spider's web. (4.-S.)", "bbox": {"x": 174.57142840081968, "y": 1511.249999980731, "width": 221.57142857142858, "height": 23.50833333333325}}, {"kind": "text", "text": "Cursor Mundi, MS. Coll. Trin. Cantab. f. 52,", "bbox": {"x": 563.9999998304473, "y": 1514.6083333248528, "width": 342.4285714285715, "height": 16.791666666666785}}, {"kind": "text", "text": "34", "bbox": {"x": 822.499999832143, "y": 1534.758333213393, "width": 30.214285714285637, "height": 16.791666666666785}}], "ms": 300.036084}